ikuti rute evakuasi yang benar.\n- Evaluasi Interaktif: Dapatkan skor dan masukan atas keputusan Anda, dengan saran untuk sesi berikutnya.\nPelajari cara melindungi diri dengan cara yang menarik dan aman, meningkatkan kesadaran dan kesiapsiagaan Anda terhadap bencana.", "short_description": "Aplikasi VR Simulasi Bencana merupakan aplikasi yang membantu pengguna memahami prosedur evakuasi, mengenali tanda bahaya, dan mempraktikkan tindakan penyelamatan dengan aman."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/inovtek3-privacy-policy-vr/vr-simulasi", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BNPB Inovtek", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.instagram.com/bnpb_indonesia/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["id"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24264747573124991"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2813280805516649"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2813280805516649"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1746196200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2813280805516649"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24266619239604491", "version": "0.0.6"}, "id": "1304575187345673", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binar